<view class="page"><view class="card petlis-list-card"><view class="hint">修改后所有旧登录会话将失效。密码不会保存在设备中。</view><view wx:if="{{reset}}"><view wx:if="{{!capabilities.smsConfigured}}" class="hint">短信验证暂未开放，请联系实验室处理账号问题。</view><view class="form-item"><view class="form-label">注册手机号</view><input class="petlis-input" data-field="mobile" value="{{mobile}}" bindinput="field" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="请输入注册手机号"/></view><view class="form-item"><view class="form-label">短信验证码</view><view class="row"><input class="petlis-input" data-field="code" value="{{code}}" bindinput="field" type="number" maxlength="6" placeholder="请输入短信验证码"/><button class="petlis-btn petlis-btn-outline" bindtap="sms" disabled="{{busy || countdown>0 || !capabilities.smsConfigured}}">{{countdown?countdown+'秒后重发':'获取验证码'}}</button></view></view></view><view wx:else class="form-item"><view class="form-label">原密码</view><input class="petlis-input" data-field="oldPassword" value="{{oldPassword}}" bindinput="field" password placeholder="请输入原密码"/></view><view class="form-item"><view class="form-label">新密码</view><input class="petlis-input" data-field="newPassword" value="{{newPassword}}" bindinput="field" password maxlength="72" placeholder="至少8位字母和数字"/></view><view class="form-item"><view class="form-label">确认新密码</view><input class="petlis-input" data-field="confirmPassword" value="{{confirmPassword}}" bindinput="field" password maxlength="72" placeholder="再次输入新密码"/></view></view><view wx:if="{{!reset}}"><view class="card petlis-list-card"><view>微信登录</view><view class="hint">仅绑定你本人使用的微信账号。</view><button class="petlis-btn petlis-btn-outline" bindtap="wechat" disabled="{{busy || !capabilities.wechatConfigured}}">绑定当前微信</button></view><view class="card petlis-list-card"><view>修改手机号</view><view wx:if="{{!capabilities.smsConfigured}}" class="hint">短信验证暂未开放，换绑手机号暂不可用。</view><view class="form-item"><view class="form-label">新手机号</view><input class="petlis-input" data-field="mobile" value="{{mobile}}" bindinput="field" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="请输入新手机号"/></view><view class="form-item"><view class="form-label">新号码验证码</view><view class="row"><input class="petlis-input" data-field="code" value="{{code}}" bindinput="field" type="number" maxlength="6" placeholder="请输入新号码收到的验证码"/><button class="petlis-btn petlis-btn-outline" bindtap="sms" disabled="{{busy || countdown>0 || !capabilities.smsConfigured}}">{{countdown?countdown+'秒后重发':'获取验证码'}}</button></view></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="petlis-empty"><image class="empty-icon" src="/assets/icons/brand-empty.png" mode="aspectFit" /><view class="petlis-empty-text">{{error}}</view><button class="petlis-btn petlis-btn-outline petlis-empty-retry" bindtap="password">重试</button></view><view class="bottom-actions"><button wx:if="{{!reset}}" class="petlis-btn petlis-btn-outline" bindtap="mobile" disabled="{{busy || !capabilities.smsConfigured}}">验证并换绑</button><button class="petlis-btn petlis-btn-primary" bindtap="password" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || (reset && !capabilities.smsConfigured)}}">保存新密码</button></view></view>
